    "text": "<p>The current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math> respectively for the given circuit is :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/96d424cf-d5b4-40fb-87f6-17984f076b7c-image.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 181px;\" /></p>",
